            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Design your own menu bar clock with a custom date and time format, a live preview and tap-to-use examples</li>
  <li>Add the year to the menu bar clock with the new Year option</li>
  <li>Try every Pro feature free for 14 days</li>
  <li>Upgrade to Pro from a new, easy to browse screen</li>
  <li>See your Pro status at a glance in General settings</li>
  <li>Enjoy refreshed settings icons</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
