        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Keep the time in view with a new on screen clock you can drag anywhere</li>
  <li>See how far through the year you are with a new year progress card in the panel</li>
  <li>Build your menu bar clock your way by choosing what it shows, with new label styles</li>
  <li>Enjoy a cleaner menu bar with more room around the icon and clock</li>
  <li>Removing a world clock is now smooth, with a neatly centered empty state</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
