        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>See your month, today's agenda and world clocks in a glass panel right from the menu bar</li>
  <li>Join Zoom, Google Meet, Teams and more in one click, with a countdown to your next meeting</li>
  <li>Get reminded before meetings with notifications, a full screen alert or a playful plane banner</li>
  <li>Create events by typing naturally, like "Dentist next Friday 9:30", with Apple Intelligence</li>
  <li>Slide through time with world clocks to find a good meeting slot across time zones</li>
  <li>See and complete your reminders right in the agenda</li>
  <li>Make it yours with themes, fonts, an hourly chime and keyboard shortcuts</li>
  <li>Available in English, Spanish, Japanese and Simplified Chinese</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
